      "markdown": "Table 5-8: Description of sound alarm of buzzer\n\n| Short single alarm   | Give this alarm when pressing any functional operation key                                                                                                             |\n|----------------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Continual alarm      | Give this alarm when UPS is under fault                                                                                                                                |\n| Distant alarm        | Give this alarm once 2 seconds when battery is discharging Give this alarm once 1 second when battery is discharging and voltage is lower than low-voltage alarm point |",
