        "r": 541.61568,
        "b": 276.306101363195
      },
      "content": "LCD displays friendly interface and provides 320 x 240 raster graphic display. LCD can display the alarm information real-time, provide 10,000 historical alarm records for inquiry of user, and provide reliable basis for fault diagnosis.",
      "section_id": "sec_5_1_4",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_5_1",
      "section_level": 3,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_5",
