      "section": "5.1.4 LCD Touch Screen and Menu Button",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 77.904,
        "t": 270.1776629101563,
        "r": 541.61568,
        "b": 213.87610136319495
      },
      "content": "User can execute various operational commands through LCD touch screen interface, check input, output,  load,  and  battery  parameter  conveniently,  and  obtain  current  UPS  status  and  warning information timely. Besides, LCD can display version information of control software and monitoring board software.",
